        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
        "description": {
            "content": "This research specification contains only Microsoft Graph operations observed in authenticated\nMicrosoft portals that were absent from both the pinned official Microsoft Graph v1.0 and beta\nOpenAPI contracts at review time.\n\nThese operations are undocumented, unsupported, and potentially unstable. Their presence here\ndoes not imply Microsoft support or suitability for production use. Every operation is admitted\nonly after successful live evidence, structured request or response shapes, corroboration, and\ncomparison with a pinned `microsoftgraph/msgraph-metadata` snapshot. Portal proxy transports and\nthe Graph `$batch` wrapper remain evidence transports; paths in this specification are canonical\ndirect Microsoft Graph operations.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: nodoc",
            "type": "text/plain"
